      "content": [
        "# MD-JSON Synchronization System: Agent Architecture\r",
        "\r",
        "## Overview\r",
        "\r",
        "This document outlines the distributed agent architecture for the MD-JSON synchronization system, following a modular approach where independent agents handle specific aspects of the synchronization process.\r",
        "\r",
        "## Agent Types and Responsibilities\r",
        "\r",
        "### Alpha Agent: File System Monitor\r",
        "- Monitors file changes using intelligent event debouncing\r",
        "- Handles directory watching with proper exclusion patterns\r",
        "- Provides file change notifications to other agents\r",
        "- Manages root directory monitoring\r",
        "\r",
        "### Beta Agent: Content Transformer\r",
        "- Handles Markdown to JSON conversion\r",
        "- Ensures content structure preservation \r",
        "- Implements validation checks for data integrity\r",
        "- Prevents destructive transformations\r",
        "\r",
        "### Gamma Agent: Conflict Resolver\r",
        "- Implements intelligent section-level merging\r",
        "- Manages conflict resolution between formats\r",
        "- Preserves historical content during merges\r",
        "- Detects and prevents content reduction\r",
        "\r",
        "### Delta Agent: Safety Manager\r",
        "- Creates and manages versioned backups\r",
        "- Implements transaction-based operations\r",
        "- Handles lock file management\r",
        "- Provides recovery mechanisms\r",
        "\r",
        "### Epsilon Agent: Process Controller\r",
        "- Manages process lifecycle\r",
        "- Implements Cursor process detection\r",
        "- Prevents multiple instances\r",
        "- Handles graceful shutdown\r",
        "\r",
        "## Communication Protocol\r",
        "\r",
        "Agents communicate through a message bus that allows for:\r",
        "- Event-based notifications\r",
        "- Task delegation\r",
        "- Status reporting\r",
        "- Error handling\r",
        "\r",
        "## Implementation Timeline\r",
        "\r",
        "| Phase | Focus | Estimated Hours | Primary Agents |\r",
        "|-------|-------|-----------------|----------------|\r",
        "| 1 | Core Architecture | 1-2 hours | Epsilon |\r",
        "| 2 | Synchronization Engine | 2-3 hours | Beta, Gamma |\r",
        "| 3 | Safety Features | 1-2 hours | Delta |\r",
        "| 4 | Monitoring System | 1-2 hours | Alpha |\r",
        "| 5 | Integration & Testing | 2-3 hours | All |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Parallel Processing Strategy\r",
        "\r",
        "The system will implement parallel processing where safe, with the following constraints:\r",
        "- File operations are serialized per file to prevent race conditions\r",
        "- Content transformation can occur in parallel for different files\r",
        "- Monitoring runs concurrently with transformation \r",
        "- Safety operations take priority and can block other operations"
      ]
    }
  ],
